  "data": {
    "ruleType": "army-rule",
    "summary": "Armies using Agents of the Imperium as their Army Faction may choose one of the publication’s Agents detachments in the usual way. A different host may add Agents units if all its models have the Imperium keyword. The allowances for Retinue, Character and Requisitioned units are respectively 1/1/1 at Incursion, 2/2/1 at Strike Force and 3/3/2 at Onslaught. Agents Dedicated Transports are available through the usual rules. Each must begin with at least one unit aboard. An empty transport is barred from deployment and counts as destroyed in the opening battle round.",
